+
+- **EXECUTABLE:** implementation in `packages/ca_runtime/src/ca_runtime/storyboard_session.py`.
+- **SCHEMA:** `SourceQualityProfile` / `TransformationValidationResult` Pydantic models and additive `VisualAssetReference` field.
